        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor Client as Postman / API Consumer\n    participant Controller as CustomerController\n    participant UseCase as CustomerUseCaseImpl\n    participant Strategy as CustomerValidationStrategy\n    participant Adapter as CustomerPersistenceAdapter\n    participant Mongo as MongoDB (db_pivot_customer)\n\n    Client-&gt;&gt;Controller: POST /api/v1/customers (CustomerRequest JSON)\n    activate Controller\n    Controller-&gt;&gt;UseCase: execute(Customer domainModel)\n    activate UseCase\n\n    UseCase-&gt;&gt;Strategy: supports(customer.getCustomerType())\n    activate Strategy\n    Strategy--&gt;&gt;UseCase: true (PersonalCustomerStrategy or BusinessCustomerStrategy)\n    UseCase-&gt;&gt;Strategy: validate(customer)\n    Strategy--&gt;&gt;UseCase: Completable.complete() (Valid fields &amp; profile)\n    deactivate Strategy\n\n    UseCase-&gt;&gt;Adapter: existsByDocumentNumber(documentNumber)\n    activate Adapter\n    Adapter-&gt;&gt;Mongo: existsByDocumentNumber(documentNumber)\n    activate Mongo\n    Mongo--&gt;&gt;Adapter: Mono&lt;Boolean&gt; (false)\n    deactivate Mongo\n    Adapter--&gt;&gt;UseCase: Single&lt;Boolean&gt; (false)\n    deactivate Adapter\n\n    alt Document Number Already Exists\n        UseCase--&gt;&gt;Controller: Single.error(DuplicateCustomerException)\n        Controller--&gt;&gt;Client: HTTP 409 Conflict (ErrorResponse)\n    else Document Number is Unique\n        UseCase-&gt;&gt;Adapter: save(customer)\n        activate Adapter\n        Adapter-&gt;&gt;Mongo: save(CustomerDocument)\n        activate Mongo\n        Mongo--&gt;&gt;Adapter: Mono&lt;CustomerDocument&gt;\n        deactivate Mongo\n        Adapter--&gt;&gt;UseCase: Single&lt;Customer&gt;\n        deactivate Adapter\n        UseCase--&gt;&gt;Controller: Single&lt;Customer&gt;\n        deactivate UseCase\n        Controller--&gt;&gt;Client: HTTP 201 Created (CustomerResponse JSON)\n        deactivate Controller\n    end&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="NoPtorzk0nnpLWjhdkhB-1">
